     4	 * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
     5	 *
     6	 * EK79007 MIPI-DSI panel controller interface.
     7	 *
     8	 * This is a panel-control driver.  It sends DCS/vendor commands and can
     9	 * optionally bind a caller-owned P4 DPI panel lifecycle.  The SoC adapter
    10	 * retains DMA and timing programming, while the board retains reset GPIO and
    11	 * backlight control.
    12	 ****************************************************************************/
